self.KB_CONTENT["card:757663"]={"id":"card:757663","ty":"card","sourceId":"757663","title":"『廠商預計進貨表』中的『Email』為何？","ver":"iGP","topic":"進貨","keywords":["進貨","廠商","預計","傳送"],"y":"other","answer":"* 尚未購買『FAX/Email處理系統』(FEP)者，此欄位不可輸入。* 當Email為Y時，[選擇Email傳送方式] 欄位才可輸入，可選擇利用Email發給廠商。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
